ith Wilson’s disease who are intolerant of penicillamine. Clinical experience with Syprine…"],["CHEMBL609","ORPHA:905","ema","EMEA/H/C/004005","Cuprior EPAR (Authorised) — Cuprior is indicated for the treatment of Wilson''s disease in adults, adolescents and children ≥ 5 years intolerant to D-penicillamine therapy."],["CHEMBL689","ORPHA:586","ema","EMEA/H/C/001252","Bronchitol EPAR (Authorised) — Bronchitol is indicated for the treatment of cystic fibrosis (CF) in adults aged 18 years and above as an add-on therapy to best standard of care."],["CHEMBL70927","ORPHA:232","fda","DailyMed:946718ff-df43-1baa-74d1-e5bcfbe8ad86","FERRIPROX label — ent of transfusional iron overload in adult and pediatric patients 8 years of age and older with thalassemia syndromes, sickle cell disease or other anemias. Lim…"],["CHEMBL87493","ORPHA:33069","fda","DailyMed:e88f360e-33ad-4cd6-b2de-5ef885857c5d","Fintepla label — 1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE FINTEPLA is indicated for the treatment of seizures associated with Dravet syndrome (DS) and Lennox-Gastaut syndrome (LGS) in patients 2 y…"],["CHEMBL87493","ORPHA:33069","ema","EMEA/H/C/003933","Fintepla EPAR (Authorised) — Treatment of seizures associated with Dravet syndrome as an add-on therapy to other antiepileptic medicines for patients 2 years of age and older. Fin…"],["CHEMBL930","ORPHA:232","fda","DailyMed:d5a783f4-12ef-4326-8faa-40018e45ba3b","Endari label — 1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Endari is indicated to reduce the acute complications of sickle cell disease in adult and pediatric patients 5 years of age and older. ENDAR…"]]'::jsonb) c
  join public.entities t on t.type = 'treatment' and t.canonical_id = c->>0
  join public.entities d on d.type = 'disease' and d.canonical_id = c->>1
  join public.edges ed on ed.from_id = t.id and ed.to_id = d.id and ed.relation = 'treats'
 where (case when c->>2 = 'fda' then t.props->'links'->>'fda_label' else t.props->'links'->>'ema_epar' end) is not null
on conflict (edge_id, source_id, external_id) do nothing;

